WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:04.167
Nobody was home. So the parcel goes back.

2
00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:08.500
In Japan, that happens 400 million times a year.

3
00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:13.000
The carrier did nothing wrong. A parcel can only go to one fixed place.

4
00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:17.667
But you move. Work, a train, an evening out.

5
00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:24.000
So let the parcel follow you. Drop a pin on any street, and the van pulls over there.

6
00:00:24.417 --> 00:00:29.500
Most of the time you never choose at all. You set the boundaries once.

7
00:00:29.917 --> 00:00:35.333
The agent decides inside them and tells you after. Five minutes to take it back.

8
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:41.333
Delivery OS. Packages adapt to people.
